{"articleNo":"514919","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=514919&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 사회복지법인 사랑의 날개 저소득층 장애대학생 장학지원사업 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.05.26","hit":"4508","attachments":[{"name":"사랑의 날개 장학금신청안내서 및 법인 소정 양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=514919&attachNo=143762"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">사회복지법인 사랑의 날개에서 시행하는 장학지원사업을 다음과 같이 알려드리니 관심있는 학생의 많은 참여 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">□ 사업명: 제34회 사회복지법인 사랑의 날개 장학지원사업</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">□ 대상: 저소득층 장애인 대학생 총10명</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">□ 금액: 1인 1백만원(사용목적 제약 없음)</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">□ 접수기간: 2025. 6. 2.(월) ~ 7. 2.(수)&nbsp;</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">□ 접수방법: 우편접수만 가능(7월2일 소인 유효/착불 불가)</span></b></span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">□ 접수주소:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">서울특별시 강남구 학동로&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">209(</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">논현동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 6</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">층&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">사회복지법인 사랑의 날개&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">󰂕&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">06052</span></b></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"6925\"></div><p><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">□ 문의사항: 한희경 간사(02-518-3357, wingpolla@naver.com) ※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">가급적 메일로 문의요망</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">□ 접수서류: 첨부파일 참조</span></b></span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">※</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;필요 서류 중 '장학생 추천서' 관련 사항</span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">소속학부(과)장의 추천사와 날인을 받은</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;'장학생 추천서'를 받은 학생은&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">장애학생지원센터 담당자(054-478-7047)에게 연락하여 </span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">학교직인을 날인받아야 합니다.&nbsp;</span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;